Upstream-Name: BioKids
Upstream-Contact: Bilal Gurkan Sanli <bilalsanli129@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/bilalgurkansanli/BioKids
Comment: BioKids' own code, text and artwork are MIT. The source package also
 carries third-party data, listed below with its own terms. Programs BioKids
 only invokes as separate processes - dnsmasq, Chromium, espeak-ng, kiwix-serve,
 llama.cpp, whisper.cpp, Tailscale - carry their own licences and are
 dependencies, not part of this source package. Files a parent downloads at run
 time (the assistant's models, the Wikipedia excerpts) are never part of a
 package; their licences are recorded in src/biokids_ai/models.py.

