Comment: Domain lists, snapshotted by dev/update_blocklists.py; the commit and
 date are in src/biokids_core/data/blocklists/SOURCES.toml.

Files: src/biokids_core/data/tailscale/tailscale-archive-keyring.gpg
Copyright: Tailscale Inc.
License: public-key
 This is Tailscale Inc.'s public OpenPGP key for its package repository
 (fingerprint 2596A99EAAB33821893C0A79458CA832957F5868), shipped unchanged so
 that apt can verify packages from pkgs.tailscale.com. It is a public key and
 carries no licence terms of its own.

Files: src/biokids_core/data/avatars/*.png
Copyright: 2026 Bilal Gurkan Sanli
 2013-2026 Google LLC (Noto Color Emoji artwork)
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: Drawn by dev/make_greeter_art.py: an emoji from Noto Color Emoji on a
 coloured disc. The emoji images in Noto Color Emoji are Apache-2.0.

Files: src/biokids_core/data/static/fonts/*
Copyright: 2016 The Fredoka Project Authors (https://github.com/hafontia/Fredoka-One)
 2026 Bilal Gurkan Sanli (the static instances and the Turkish letters)
License: OFL-1.1
Comment: Fredoka 2.001 from github.com/google/fonts (ofl/fredoka), cut into two
 static weights by dev/make_fonts.py, which adds ğ, Ğ, ş, Ş and İ from the
 font's own letters and marks. The font has no Reserved Font Name.

